  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participatory Agriculture and Climate Transformation (PACT) Programme - Climate resilient infrastructure development in drought prone and lowland areas in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;In the framework of the Participatory Agriculture and Climate Transformation (PACT) Programme, this action aims to develop climate resilient water and market infrastructures in lowlands and drought prone areas and will provide TA to support implementing agencies and farmers associations to manage water and market infrastructure, including operation and maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Specific Objectives of this action are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;The sustainable, inclusive and equitable income of small farmers, pastoralists, agro-pastoralists and vulnerable families is enhanced.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;The sustainable management of water resources and market-related infrastructures in local communities suffering from nutritious food gaps (with a particular focus on women and the under-5 children) is improved.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
